import_ida release notes

2.1 04/14/2002
    Rewrote xfer_Read logic to eliminate memory access errors
    under NT.

2.0 02/28/2002
    Rework idatap library to make it MT-safe.  Rework program logic
    to support one thread per connection instead of one process per
    connection.  Port to NT.

1.2 12/13/2000
    Rework idatap library to override minimal gap
    servers when minimal delay policy is in effect.
    Introduce new MinimalLag parameter to support this.

1.1 12/26/1997
    initial release
